          "reason": null,
          "text": "filename: docs/choir-summary.md\n# Choir Rehearsal Summary\n\n## Key Points  \nMarta led the warm-up and focused on breathing techniques for ten minutes, helping singers improve their vocal control.  \nOwen arrived late due to a delayed bus, but he quickly joined the group and contributed during the rehearsal.  \nThe folk song \"Down by the River\" was performed, with Priya noting that the altos tend to rush the second verse.  \nThe group slowed the tempo and practiced clapping the rhythm together to improve timing and cohesion.  \nMarta suggested marking breath points in everyone's sheet music to help with phrasing and transitions.  \nThe tenors continue to struggle with the high note near the end of the piece, requiring further attention.  \nTea and biscuits were provided by the hall committee, creating a welcoming atmosphere.  \nThe spring concert has been scheduled for the second Saturday of April.  \nPriya will book two additional rehearsals in March to ensure the group is well-prepared.  \n\n## Next Steps  \nEveryone should bring a pencil and a water bottle to the next rehearsal.  \nOwen has offered to print fresh copies of the score before Friday, which will help with consistency.  \nThe group will continue working on breath points and vocal timing in upcoming sessions.  \nPriya will coordinate the booking of the extra rehearsals in March.  \nMarta will lead the next warm-up and focus on vocal endurance.  \nThe next rehearsal is scheduled to start at seven thirty sharp, and punctuality is expected.  \nAll singers should review their sheet music and prepare for the high note in the final section.  \nOwen will ensure the score is available for all members by Friday.  \nMarta and Priya will meet after rehearsal to discuss progress and adjustments.  \nThe group will practice the rhythm and phrasing together to build confidence.  \nWe will evaluate the performance of the folk song in the next session.  \nOwen and Marta will share feedback on the group’s progress during the next meeting.  \nPriya will confirm the hall booking details and share them with the choir by the end of the week.",
